# ZTE B760H device node labels
#
# /dev/mali is created by configs/init/ueventd.mt8127.rc with mode 0666
# system:graphics, but without an entry here it inherits the generic
# `device' type and every process that touches the GPU is denied.
#
# See device.te for the full denial breakdown.
/dev/mali                                    u:object_r:mali_device:s0